1. She had a traumatic childhood experience with a moth infestation, having counted 50 moths in her small room. (Verbatim: "Flashback to when I was sat in a room, a tiny box room, with 50 moths. I wish that was an exaggerated number. I really do. But it wasn't. I counted.")

