10. She has experience with outdoor survival and hydration in extreme environments, such as rainforests, where she used sodium hydration sachets. (Verbatim: "when i was in the forest i had to have these like sodium sachet things these hydration sachets to add to my water because water on its own wouldn't be sufficient") [end of text]



