5. Her father saw her stream when her brother showed it to him, but he never commented on it. (Verbatim: "the moment that it swapped to was i like to do this joke... my father never said anything never brought it up")

6. She often uses voiceplay, switching between deep and high-pitched voices for comedic effect. (Verbatim: "i like to swap voices quite a lot... really fun to give the sort of emotional whiplash between like a really deep voice and then really swap it up to like a really high-pitched voice")

